WEBVTT

NOTE Quarry Materials — annual review

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.000
<v Priya Raman>You said on email that invoicing has been rough since the acquisition.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:21.000
<v Halvard Nyberg>Two systems, two invoice formats. Our finance team re-keys about four hundred invoices a month into the old system, and about one in twenty comes out wrong, which means a credit note and an apology.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Halvard Nyberg>The credit notes are the part that actually costs us customers.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
<v Priya Raman>Is there an appetite to consolidate onto one system?

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Halvard Nyberg>There is, but not before the ERP project finishes. What would help now is an importer that reads the new format.
